				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-150224#post-4609281</guid>
				<title>Re: Operational Staff Post</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-150224/scp-2558-j#post-4609281</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2020 23:56:47 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>The Great Hippo</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>3938622</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>With permission of staff, I'd like to submit the following images as replacements:</p> <ul> <li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Curled-cat-in-ball.jpg">For 2452128080083335089WSVQtb_fs.jpg</a> (I'll edit it to take out the ears/head).</li> <li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:White_kitten.jpg">For 2854970750_46Bf0ct.jpg</a>.</li> <li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Monstruo_-_Weimar_Meneses_(7253622860).jpg">For 793723_5bc3cb0662_m.jpg</a>.</li> <li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Britskorthaar_kitten.JPG">For 907453547_4_d4w.jpg</a>.</li> <li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scottish_Kitten.png">For 98d3c8d2-1a92-46d2-9d0f-90d9c644c525.jpg</a>.</li> <li><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:GC_RW_Topknot_James_Bond_of_Lions_%26_Owls_RW_Best_Black_Persian_2016-2017.jpg">For SCP-2558-J-(13)</a></li> </ul> <p>For the last one, I'd like to slightly modify the caption, adding:</p> <blockquote> <p>(photo taken mid-transformation)</p> </blockquote> <p><strong>ETA:</strong> Looking up these images led me to discover that there's a whole category dedicated not just to <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Curled_up_cats">curled up cats</a>, but <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Low_quality_images_of_cats">low quality images of cats</a>.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
